## Limitations and Future Improvements

This project uses historical data and focuses on descriptive analysis rather than predicting individual defaults. The findings show associations, not causation, and may not generalize to current banking populations.

Future improvements could include predictive modeling, advanced SQL analysis, and additional model performance and fairness evaluations.

